14070/extras/62d488dcd652cdbeb2b55de0ccebe98f.mp4?t=1668389705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In Score Attack mode, the more the player runs, the more points he gets! They can even raise the score by collecting turbo or hitting the crocodile with the broom powerup.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survival</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714070/extras/dae1030ca05de247fd78a2dcddb83819.poster.avif?t=1668389705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714070/extras/dae1030ca05de247fd78a2dcddb83819.webm?t=1668389705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714070/extras/dae1030ca05de247fd78a2dcddb83819.mp4?t=1668389705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In this mode, you must survive through the rounds, dodging obstacles, holes and other hazards in the city, while still worrying about the crocodile.<br>Show that you are the best and survive the most rounds!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ranking</h2>Your best scores will be stored in your local ranking, and you can compare them with the global ranking. How about challenging your friends and see who\u2019s on top?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character Customization</h2>Run run run features a character customization system, on which the player can change their character\u2019s clothes, choose hair details, effects and eye colors. These are some of the many options available to customize your character and leave it as you want.",
